# Seed config for the PRIVATE test package. Carries real intel-source keys on
# purpose (that package is not meant to be sanitized), so it must never enter
# history -- a committed key is unrecoverable once pushed, unlike one sitting in
# a local folder. The shareable counterpart, packaging/appsettings.portable.json,
# is key-free by construction and stays tracked.
packaging/appsettings.private.json
packaging/appsettings.json.backup-*
Bulwark/appsettings.private.json.bak-*
# 服务主配置含真实情报源 API 密钥,不入库;改用 appsettings.example.json 模板
